post-stir diagnostic order-നെ ആശ്രയിക്കാതെ, latched drop-46 order-ിൽ queried bowl-ന്റെ circular successor കണ്ടെത്തുന്ന Stage 1 lookup. input ആദ്യം ആറു latched IDs, പിന്നെ queried ID; output successor ID.

Hamlet, position 1 ID സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Juliet, position 2 ID സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Romeo, position 3 ID സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Othello, position 4 ID സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Macbeth, position 5 ID സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Lady Macbeth, position 6 ID സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Ophelia, queried bowl ID സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Cordelia, successor ID സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Prospero, input-output-ും branch-ും സഹായിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.

Act I: latched order വായിക്കുന്നു.

Scene I: order-ും query-യും വായിക്കുന്നു.
[Enter Prospero and Hamlet]
Prospero: Listen to your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Juliet]
Prospero: Listen to your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Romeo]
Prospero: Listen to your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Othello]
Prospero: Listen to your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Macbeth]
Prospero: Listen to your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Lady Macbeth]
Prospero: Listen to your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Ophelia]
Prospero: Listen to your heart.
[Exeunt]

Act II: circular successor search.

Scene I: position 1 പരിശോധിക്കുന്നു.
[Enter Prospero and Ophelia]
Ophelia: Am I as good as Hamlet?
Prospero: If so, let us proceed to scene VII.
Ophelia: Am I as good as Juliet?
Prospero: If so, let us proceed to scene VIII.
Ophelia: Am I as good as Romeo?
Prospero: If so, let us proceed to scene IX.
Ophelia: Am I as good as Othello?
Prospero: If so, let us proceed to scene X.
Ophelia: Am I as good as Macbeth?
Prospero: If so, let us proceed to scene XI.
Ophelia: Am I as good as Lady Macbeth?
Prospero: If so, let us proceed to scene XII.
Prospero: Let us proceed to act IV.

Scene VII: position 1-ന്റെ successor position 2.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Cordelia]
Prospero: You are as good as Juliet. Let us proceed to act III.
[Exeunt]

Scene VIII: position 2-ന്റെ successor position 3.
[Enter Prospero and Cordelia]
Prospero: You are as good as Romeo. Let us proceed to act III.
[Exeunt]

Scene IX: position 3-ന്റെ successor position 4.
[Enter Prospero and Cordelia]
Prospero: You are as good as Othello. Let us proceed to act III.
[Exeunt]

Scene X: position 4-ന്റെ successor position 5.
[Enter Prospero and Cordelia]
Prospero: You are as good as Macbeth. Let us proceed to act III.
[Exeunt]

Scene XI: position 5-ന്റെ successor position 6.
[Enter Prospero and Cordelia]
Prospero: You are as good as Lady Macbeth. Let us proceed to act III.
[Exeunt]

Scene XII: position 6-ന്റെ successor wrap ചെയ്ത് position 1.
[Enter Prospero and Cordelia]
Prospero: You are as good as Hamlet.
[Exeunt]

Act III: valid result.

[Exeunt]

Scene I: successor output.
[Enter Prospero and Cordelia]
Prospero: Open your heart.
[Exeunt]

Act IV: invalid query.

[Exeunt]

Scene I: order-ിൽ query ഇല്ലെങ്കിൽ zero sentinel output.
[Enter Prospero and Cordelia]
Prospero: You are nothing. Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
